    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD COLSPAN="2">
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">If the endorsement be executed by an attorney, executor, administrator,
    trustee or guardian, the</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">person executing the endorsement must give his/her full title in such
    capacity and proper evidence</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">of authority to act in such capacity, if not on file with the Depositary,
    must be forwarded with this</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Receipt.</P></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">__________________________</FONT></TD>
